            ^"Category" STRING "Animals"
            ^"Combat Conflict Rank" INTEGER 1
            ^"Intrigue Conflict Rank" INTEGER 1
            ^"Source Page" INTEGER 325
            ^"Description" STRING "Cats are small, furry felines that have cunningly shaped human society to fulfill their needs over generations of adaptation. They reside in the homes of samurai and peasants alike, providing their nominal owners with entertainment, pest control, and occasional affection."
