            #L5RN5UKpiXR9Ik2rzWy7pN: hawk_swoop "Swoop: When performing an Attack action check, a hawk may spend (op) as follows: (op)+: Move 1 range band away from the target per (op) spent this way. If the target is of silhouette 0 or smaller, the hawk may carry it to its destination instead."
        }
    }

