            ^"Skills" LIST OF STRING ["Artisan 0", "Martial 0", "Scholar 0", "Social 1", "Trade 0"]
            ^"Advantages" LIST OF STRING ["Tireless Runner: (earth) Martial; Physical"]
            ^"Disadvantages" LIST OF STRING ["Skittish: (fire) Martial; Mental"]
            ^"Favored Weapons" LIST OF STRING ["Hooves: Range 1–2, Damage 6, Deadliness 5"]
