            #L5RND0noQggK3c9WkC5olb: horse_rokugani_pony_loyal_steed "Loyal Steed: A Rokugani pony is a silhouette 3 creature. It can be ridden by a human-sized (silhouette 2 or lower) rider."
        }
    }

